#### 2. Dependency Audit Wording Correction
- **Nature of Check:** `npm audit --package-lock-only` is a network-backed, read-only registry query against `package-lock.json` (not strictly offline).
- **Single Advisory Context:** The 3 reported high-severity vulnerability entries (`deepmerge-ts`, `@prisma/config`, `prisma`) share **ONE** single underlying upstream advisory: `GHSA-ggr8-5vv4-36mx` (CWE-674, stack exhaustion when merging recursive object graphs with circular references) under devDependency `prisma`. They do not represent 3 distinct vulnerabilities.
- **Exploitability:** Plain JSON deserialization cannot generate circular references and is insufficient to trigger the condition; there is no proven runtime exploit in the application codebase.
- **Report Updated:** Documented in [`verification.md`](file:///home/tung/workspace/school/project1/lingora-workspace/plans/evidence/2026-10-28-full-project-audit/verification.md).

